{"id":"664925","name":"莲子薏米西米露","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/664925/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"莲子","amount":"适量"},{"name":"薏米","amount":"适量"},{"name":"西米","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"纯牛奶","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"莲子提前泡发后去芯。","img":"images/664925/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"薏米提前清水泡发。","img":"images/664925/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"洗净的薏米放入高压锅中。","img":"images/664925/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/664925/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"高压锅大火压15分钟。","img":"images/664925/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"薏米压好后开盖煮开。","img":"images/664925/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入莲子。","img":"images/664925/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"搅拌均匀煮开。","img":"images/664925/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入西米。","img":"images/664925/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/664925/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"盖上大火压5~8分钟左右。","img":"images/664925/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"高压锅手阀开后开盖西米已经是透明状了，加入少许白糖搅拌均匀。","img":"images/664925/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"加入适量纯牛奶拌匀即可。","img":"images/664925/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/664925/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/664925/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：高压锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}